<title>USA: Barshefsky's USTR confirmation expected soon -- Lott.</title>
<headline>Barshefsky's USTR confirmation expected soon -- Lott.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senate Majority Leader Trent Lott said Tuesday he expects the Senate will confirm Charlene Barshefsky to be U.S. Trade Representative soon.</p>
<p>Speaking to reporters, the Mississippi Republican said the Senate will begin debate on her nomination Wednesday with confirmation expected to follow shortly.</p>
